  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------ help, privacy, terms (readable signed out as well) */
  var HELP = [
    ["How do I find my way around?", "<p>Every page starts with a heading that is announced when it opens. Use <b>Tab</b> to move, <b>Enter</b> or <b>Space</b> to choose, and <b>Escape</b> to close a menu or dialog. The first link on every page is <b>Skip to main content</b>. Your sections are listed under the page title.</p>"],
    ["How do I send a message?", "<p>Open <b>Communicate</b>, pick a connected person and start a conversation. Inside the conversation you can type, speak (voice-to-text), use the phrase board or recognised signs. Anything recognised is shown for you to check and edit before you send it.</p>"],
    ["How do I change how I send or receive messages?", "<p>Open <b>Accessibility</b> (primary users) or <b>Account settings</b>. Choose several ways at once if you like, then press Save. The page tells you when it has been saved.</p>"],
    ["How do I connect with someone?", "<p>A primary user shares their private <b>invitation code</b>. A supporter enters it under <b>Connections</b> and sends a request. The primary user approves and chooses what the supporter may see. Nothing is shared before then.</p>"],
    ["What is the difference between an interpreter and a volunteer?", "<p>An interpreter has been checked by a reviewer. A volunteer helper has not. Use <b>Interpreter</b> to ask for a verified interpreter, and <b>Assistance</b> to ask for a volunteer.</p>"],
    ["How do I use voice commands?", "<p>Turn on <b>Voice-guided navigation</b> in your accessibility preferences. A <b>Voice commands</b> button appears. It listens only while you press it, once. Say things like “open dashboard”, “read current page”, “read my messages”, “increase text size”, “go back”, “stop speaking” or “repeat”. Your browser's speech service may process the sound: see the privacy policy. Voice commands are optional; everything also works with the keyboard and a screen reader.</p>"],
    ["How do I use the keyboard only?", "<p>Everything can be done without a mouse. <b>Tab</b> and <b>Shift+Tab</b> move between controls, arrow keys move inside menus and tab lists, and the focus outline always shows where you are.</p>"],
    ["Something went wrong. What now?", "<p>Messages say what happened and what to do. If a save fails, your changes stay on the page and you can try again. If a camera is blocked, allow it for this site in your browser settings. If you cannot sign in, use <a href=\"#/forgot\">Forgot your password</a>.</p>"],
    ["Why was no email sent to me?", "<p>This copy of SANGAM is not connected to an email service. It says so instead of pretending. For testing, verification and reset links are shown on the page.</p>"],
  ];
